*>   2003-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 172
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0024.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY LON0024C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIRED
    05 MI-REQUIRED        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 RATE-ADJ           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHECK-LTV
    DISPLAY "MI-REQUIRED=" MI-REQUIRED
    DISPLAY "RATE-ADJ=" RATE-ADJ
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-LTV.
    IF CU-LTV-PCT > 90
        MOVE 'Y' TO MI-REQUIRED
        MOVE 0.0050 TO RATE-ADJ
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MI-REQUIRED
    END-IF.
